    "body": "Implementation prepared ahead of its gate on branch [`mt/1262-remove-sole-tenant-fallback`](https://github.com/dvdtrsnk/semprec/tree/mt/1262-remove-sole-tenant-fallback) (head `075ea30fe`), stacked on the prepared `mt/1088-invitation-acceptance-page` branch (and so on #1067 and #1087).\n\nStatus: full backend `pnpm run verify` passed on the branch. The diff went through two independent reviews; their findings (test fixtures still reading `app_sole_tenant()`) are fixed by moving them to `getTenantZeroId()`. `git grep app_sole_tenant -- backend ':!*.sql'` now matches only `getSoleTenantId` (`tenantsStore.ts`), `globalSetup.ts`, `tenancyInvariants.ts`, and three tests that test the function or its invariant on purpose: `tenantEntity.test.ts`, `tenancyCatalog.test.ts` and `tenancyInvariants.test.ts`. Open the pull request after #1087 has landed, and list those three tests in it.",
